<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #4f46e5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { padding: 20px; background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .button { display: inline-block; margin: 16px 0; padding: 12px 24px; background: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; }
    .footer { padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome aboard!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
      <p>We're getting things ready for your start date of <strong>{{joinDate}}</strong>. Before then, please
        share a few personal details and upload the documents we'll need.</p>
      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a class="button" href="{{link}}">Complete your pre-onboarding</a>
      </p>
      <p>This link is valid until <strong>{{expiresAt}}</strong>. If it expires before you finish, ask HR to
        resend it.</p>
      <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>{{link}}</p>
      <p>Best regards,<br>HR Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
